msgid "%1% cannot exceed the shell layers (%2%), otherwise the painted color would reach the sparse infill."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Too small layer height.\n"
"Reset to 0.2"
msgstr ""
"Tinggi lapisan terlalu kecil.\n"
"Atur ulang ke 0,2"

msgid ""
"Too large layer height.\n"
"Reset to 0.2"
msgstr ""
"Tinggi lapisan terlalu besar.\n"
"Atur ulang ke 0,2"

msgid ""
"Should not be larger than layer height.\n"
"Reset to 10%"
msgstr ""
"Tidak boleh lebih besar dari tinggi lapisan.\n"
"Atur ulang ke 10%"

msgid ""
"Too small ironing spacing.\n"
"Reset to 0.1"
msgstr ""
"Jarak penyetrikaan terlalu kecil.\n"
"Atur ulang ke 0,1"

msgid ""
"Too small support ironing spacing.\n"
"Reset to 0.1"
msgstr ""
"Jarak garis penyetrikaan penyangga terlalu kecil.\n"
"Atur ulang ke 0,1"

msgid ""
"Support ironing will not work with sparse support interface.\n"
"Do you want to adjust the support interface config to use ironing?\n"
"Yes: make the support interface solid.\n"
"No: disable the support ironing."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi penyetrikaan tidak akan berfungsi dengan antarmuka penyangga sparse.\n"
" Apakah Anda ingin menyesuaikan konfigurasi antarmuka penyangga untuk menggunakan penyetrikaan?\n"
" Ya: Jadikan antarmuka penyangga padat.\n"
" Tidak: Nonaktifkan penyetrikaan penyangga."

msgid ""
"Zero initial layer height is invalid.\n"
"\n"
"The first layer height will be reset to 0.2."
msgstr ""
"Tinggi lapisan awal nol tidak valid.\n"
"\n"
"Atur ulang ke 0,2."

msgid ""
"This setting is only used for model size tuning with small value in some cases.\n"
"For example, when the model size has slight errors and is difficult be assembled.\n"
"For large size tuning, please use model scaling function.\n"
"\n"
"The value will be reset to 0."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan ini hanya digunakan untuk penyetelan ukuran model dengan nilai kecil dalam beberapa kasus.\n"
"Contohnya, saat ukuran model memiliki sedikit kesalahan dan sulit dirakit.\n"
"Untuk penyetelan ukuran besar, harap gunakan fungsi penskalaan model.\n"
"\n"
"Nilai ini akan diatur ulang menjadi 0."

msgid ""
"Too large elephant foot compensation is unreasonable.\n"
"If really have serious elephant foot effect, please check other settings.\n"
"For example, whether bed temperature is too high.\n"
"\n"
"The value will be reset to 0."
msgstr ""
"Kompensasi kaki gajah yang terlalu besar tidak wajar.\n"
"Jika memang ada efek kaki gajah yang parah, harap periksa pengaturan lainnya.\n"
"Contohnya, apakah suhu alas terlalu tinggi.\n"
"\n"
"Nilai ini akan diatur ulang menjadi 0."

msgid ""
"Interlocking beam width can't be zero when beam interlocking is enabled.\n"
"Reset to 0.01 mm."
msgstr ""
"Lebar balok saling mengunci tidak boleh nol saat penguncian balok diaktifkan.\n"
" Atur ulang ke 0,01 mm."

msgid ""
"Fuzzy skin [Extrusion] and [Combined] modes require the Arachne wall generator.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to change these settings automatically?\n"
"Yes - Enable Arachne wall generator\n"
"No - Keep current wall generator and set fuzzy skin to [Displacement] mode"
msgstr ""
"Mode [Ekstrusi] dan [Gabung] permukaan berbulu membutuhkan generator dinding Arachne.\n"
"\n"
" Apakah Anda ingin mengubah pengaturan ini secara otomatis?\n"
" Ya - Aktifkan generator dinding Arachne\n"
" Tidak - Pertahankan generator dinding saat ini dan atur permukaan berbulu ke mode [Pergeseran]"

msgid ""
"Prime tower does not work when Adaptive Layer Height or Independent Support Layer Height is on.\n"
"Which do you want to keep?\n"
"YES - Keep Prime Tower\n"
"NO  - Keep Adaptive Layer Height and Independent Support Layer Height"
msgstr ""
"Menara prime tidak berfungsi saat Tinggi Lapisan Adaptif atau Tinggi Lapisan Penyangga Independen diaktifkan secara bersamaan.\n"
"Anda ingin mempertahankan yang mana?\n"
"YA - Pertahankan Menara Prime\n"
"TIDAK - Pertahankan Tinggi Lapisan Adaptif dan Tinggi Lapisan Penyangga Independen"

msgid ""
"Prime tower does not work when Adaptive Layer Height is on.\n"
"Which do you want to keep?\n"
"YES - Keep Prime Tower\n"
"NO  - Keep Adaptive Layer Height"
msgstr ""
"Menara prime tidak berfungsi saat Tinggi Lapisan Adaptif diaktifkan.\n"
"Anda ingin mempertahankan yang mana?\n"
"YA - Pertahankan Menara Prime\n"
"TIDAK - Pertahankan Tinggi Lapisan Adaptif"

msgid ""
"Prime tower does not work when Independent Support Layer Height is on.\n"
"Which do you want to keep?\n"
"YES - Keep Prime Tower\n"
"NO  - Keep Independent Support Layer Height"
msgstr ""
"Menara prime tidak berfungsi saat Tinggi Lapisan Penyangga Independen diaktifkan.\n"
"Anda ingin mempertahankan yang mana?\n"
"YA - Pertahankan Menara Prime\n"
"TIDAK - Pertahankan Tinggi Lapisan Penyangga Independen"

