msgstr "Nonaktifkan mode vas spiral."

msgid ""
"Change these settings automatically?\n"
"Yes - Apply and keep alternate extra wall enabled\n"
"No  - Don't use alternate extra wall"
msgstr ""
"Ubah pengaturan ini secara otomatis?\n"
"Ya - Terapkan dan biarkan lapisan dinding ekstra bergantian aktif\n"
"Tidak - Jangan gunakan lapisan dinding ekstra bergantian"

msgid "For alternate extra wall to work properly, the following adjustments are recommended:"
msgstr "Agar lapisan dinding ekstra bergantian berfungsi dengan baik, penyesuaian berikut direkomendasikan:"

msgid ""
"Apply these adjustments?\n"
"Yes - Apply and keep alternate extra wall enabled\n"
"No  - Keep current settings and alternate extra wall enabled"
msgstr ""
"Terapkan penyesuaian ini?\n"
"Ya - Terapkan dan biarkan lapisan dinding ekstra bergantian aktif\n"
"Tidak - Pertahankan pengaturan saat ini dan biarkan lapisan dinding ekstra bergantian aktif"

msgid "Spiral mode only works when wall loops is 1, support is disabled, clumping detection by probing is disabled, top shell layers is 0, sparse infill density is 0, timelapse type is instant, smoothing wall speed in z direction is false and alternate extra wall is disabled."
msgstr ""

