msgstr "Harap selesaikan pemasangan rak hotend dan coba lagi."

msgid "Please refresh the nozzle information and try again."
msgstr "Harap segarkan informasi nosel dan coba lagi."

msgid "Please re-slice."
msgstr "Harap potong ulang."

